-- Independent tests for row IL-30 (BACKLOG IL-56), written by fid-il-30.
-- Every expected value is taken from DECIDED-ANSWERS.md (sha256 01c7fcfbf20e44abbe8f3717507b89d1fe2cd059d177f594dc67dd2005e6bd58),
-- which was written from the Hebrew sources alone before this encoding was opened.
-- Each assertion is preceded by the id of the decided case it tests.
-- A failing assertion is a finding. An assertion that refuses where a value is expected is a finding or a scope limit,
-- classified in INDEPENDENT-FINDINGS.md. No expected value was changed to fit the encoding.
-- Expected refusals are asserted with #ASSERT REFUSED, which counts as satisfied.

§ `Independent tests of row IL-30`

§§ `Fixtures`

GIVEN u IS A NUMBER
      r IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A band of a marginal scale`
`a band ending at` u `at the rate` r MEANS
    `A band of a marginal scale` WITH
        `upper limit of the band` IS JUST u
        `rate of the band`        IS r

GIVEN r IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A band of a marginal scale`
`a last band at the rate` r MEANS
    `A band of a marginal scale` WITH
        `upper limit of the band` IS NOTHING
        `rate of the band`        IS r

`the scale of s 121(a)` MEANS
    LIST `a band ending at` 301_200 `at the rate` (31%),
         `a band ending at` 560_280 `at the rate` (35%),
         `a last band at the rate` (47%)

`the scale of s 121(b)(1)` MEANS
    LIST `a band ending at` 84_120 `at the rate` (10%),
         `a band ending at` 120_720 `at the rate` (14%),
         `a band ending at` 228_000 `at the rate` (20%),
         `a band ending at` 301_200 `at the rate` (31%),
         `a band ending at` 560_280 `at the rate` (35%),
         `a last band at the rate` (47%)

GIVEN f IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Holdings of means of control in one body of persons`
`a profits holding of` f MEANS
    `Holdings of means of control in one body of persons` WITH
        `fraction of the right to profits`                                              IS f
        `fraction of the right to appoint a director or general manager`                IS 0
        `fraction of the voting rights in the general meeting`                          IS 0
        `fraction of the right to a share of the surplus assets on winding up`          IS 0
        `fraction of the right to direct the holder of a right in (1) to (4) on how to use it` IS 0

GIVEN f IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Holdings of means of control in one body of persons`
`a voting holding of` f MEANS
    `Holdings of means of control in one body of persons` WITH
        `fraction of the right to profits`                                              IS 0
        `fraction of the right to appoint a director or general manager`                IS 0
        `fraction of the voting rights in the general meeting`                          IS f
        `fraction of the right to a share of the surplus assets on winding up`          IS 0
        `fraction of the right to direct the holder of a right in (1) to (4) on how to use it` IS 0

GIVEN f IS A NUMBER
      g IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Holdings of means of control in one body of persons`
`a profits holding of` f `and a voting holding of` g MEANS
    `Holdings of means of control in one body of persons` WITH
        `fraction of the right to profits`                                              IS f
        `fraction of the right to appoint a director or general manager`                IS 0
        `fraction of the voting rights in the general meeting`                          IS g
        `fraction of the right to a share of the surplus assets on winding up`          IS 0
        `fraction of the right to direct the holder of a right in (1) to (4) on how to use it` IS 0

GIVEN f IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A person who may hold together with the person`
`a sibling's profits holding of` f MEANS
    `A person who may hold together with the person` WITH
        `holdings` IS `a profits holding of` f
        `tie to the person` IS `a tie of paragraph (1)` `sibling`
        `regularly cooperates with the person by agreement on material matters of the body` IS FALSE

GIVEN f IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A person who may hold together with the person`
`a cooperating stranger's profits holding of` f MEANS
    `A person who may hold together with the person` WITH
        `holdings` IS `a profits holding of` f
        `tie to the person` IS `no tie`
        `regularly cooperates with the person by agreement on material matters of the body` IS TRUE

GIVEN f IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A person who may hold together with the person`
`a stranger's profits holding of` f MEANS
    `A person who may hold together with the person` WITH
        `holdings` IS `a profits holding of` f
        `tie to the person` IS `no tie`
        `regularly cooperates with the person by agreement on material matters of the body` IS FALSE

GIVETH A LIST OF `A person who may hold together with the person`
`no others` MEANS EMPTY

GIVETH A LIST OF `The holdings of a person on one day`
`no records` MEANS EMPTY

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      f IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `The holdings of a person on one day`
`a profits record on` d `of` f MEANS
    `The holdings of a person on one day` WITH
        `the day` IS d
        `the person's own holdings that day` IS `a profits holding of` f
        `the others who may hold together with the person that day` IS `no others`

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      f IS A NUMBER
      g IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `The holdings of a person on one day`
`a profits record on` d `of` f `with a sibling of` g MEANS
    `The holdings of a person on one day` WITH
        `the day` IS d
        `the person's own holdings that day` IS `a profits holding of` f
        `the others who may hold together with the person that day` IS LIST `a sibling's profits holding of` g

GIVEN tg IS A `A reading of "together with another"`
      dy IS A `A reading of how the days of a period are counted`
      hf IS A `A reading of half the holding expenses in the adjusted price`
      tw IS A `A reading of the twelve months before a day`
      y49 IS A `A reading of the years counted from 1949 in section 91(f)(1)`
      y05 IS A `A reading of the years counted from 2005 in section 91(f)(2)`
      cp IS A `A reading of a cap on the rate where the gain stands in several bands`
      od IS A `A reading of where each part of a gain stands in the top layer`
      t125 IS A `A reading of the time at which section 125B(3) tests the shareholding`
      b3 IS A `A reading of the time at which section 91(b)(3) tests the shareholding`
      mid IS A `A reading of the real gain used for the middle part of a security bought before the fixed date`
      tx IS A `A reading of how a tax year of the Real Estate Taxation Law is named`
GIVETH A `The readings of the forks in sections 88, 91, 125B and 125C`
`ind readings: together` tg `, days` dy `, half` hf `, twelve` tw `, y49` y49 `, y05` y05 `, cap` cp `, places` od `, t125` t125 `, b3` b3 `, mid` mid `, tax` tx MEANS
    `The readings of the forks in sections 88, 91, 125B and 125C` WITH
        `together with another`                   IS tg
        `counting the days of a period`           IS dy
        `half the holding expenses`               IS hf
        `the twelve months before a day`          IS tw
        `the years from 1949 in section 91(f)(1)` IS y49
        `the years from 2005 in section 91(f)(2)` IS y05
        `a cap where the gain stands in several bands` IS cp
        `where each part stands in the top layer` IS od
        `the time of the test in section 125B(3)` IS t125
        `the time of the test in section 91(b)(3)` IS b3
        `the real gain for the middle part`       IS mid
        `the naming of a tax year of the Real Estate Taxation Law` IS tx



GIVEN market IS A NUMBER
      agreed IS A NUMBER
      good   IS A BOOLEAN
      land   IS A BOOLEAN
      writ   IS A BOOLEAN
      exp    IS A NUMBER
      redeem IS A BOOLEAN
      diff   IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `The facts that settle the consideration`
`ind price facts:` market `, agreed` agreed `, officer satisfied` good `, land` land `, in writing` writ `, expenses` exp `, redemption` redeem `, index differences` diff MEANS
    `The facts that settle the consideration` WITH
        `the price to be expected from a willing seller to a willing buyer, the asset free of any charge securing a debt` IS market
        `the price agreed` IS agreed
        `the assessing officer is satisfied the agreed price was fixed in good faith, uninfluenced by special relations between seller and buyer` IS good
        `a right in land` IS land
        `the sale was made in writing` IS writ
        `the expenses of the sale the taxpayer incurred in that sale` IS exp
        `a bond or commercial security is redeemed` IS redeem
        `the index differences on the redemption` IS diff

GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN
      b IS A BOOLEAN
      c IS A BOOLEAN
      d IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `What is sold`
`ind thing sold, personal movables` a `inventory` b `possessory right` c `betterment right` d MEANS
    `What is sold` WITH
        `movables of an individual held for the personal use of the individual, family or dependants` IS a
        `business inventory` IS b
        `a possessory right in land used for living and not for gain` IS c
        `a right in land or in a land association on whose sale betterment tax is imposed, or would be but for an exemption` IS d


GIVEN recs IS A LIST OF `The holdings of a person on one day`
GIVETH A `The recipient of a dividend, for section 125B`
`ind dividend individual with` recs MEANS `an individual` recs

GIVEN recs IS A LIST OF `The holdings of a person on one day`
GIVETH A `The seller, for section 91`
`ind seller individual with` recs MEANS `an individual` recs


GIVEN rate IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `The seller, for section 91`
`ind body taxed at` rate MEANS `a body of persons` rate

`ind default` MEANS 
    `ind readings: together` `declined where the number of others changes the answer` `, days` `declined where the way of counting changes the answer` `, half` `declined where half the holding expenses changes the answer` `, twelve` `declined where the first day of the twelve months changes the answer` `, y49` `declined where the number of years changes the answer` `, y05` `declined where the number of years changes the answer` `, cap` `declined where the way of applying the cap changes the answer` `, places` `declined where the order of the parts changes the answer` `, t125` `declined where the time of the test changes the answer` `, b3` `declined where the time of the sale test changes the answer` `, mid` `declined where the real gain used for the middle part changes the answer` `, tax` `declined where the naming of the tax year changes the answer`

