#ASSERT `s 88 — the tie makes a relative` (`a tie of paragraph (1)` `sibling`)
-- K03
#ASSERT `s 88 — the tie makes a relative` (`a tie of paragraph (1)` `parent`)
-- K04
#ASSERT `s 88 — the tie makes a relative` (`a tie of paragraph (1)` `parent of a parent`)
-- K05
#ASSERT `s 88 — the tie makes a relative` (`a tie of paragraph (1)` `descendant`)
-- K06
#ASSERT `s 88 — the tie makes a relative` (`a tie of paragraph (1)` `descendant`)
-- K07
#ASSERT `s 88 — the tie makes a relative` (`a tie of paragraph (1)` `descendant of a spouse`)
-- K08
