§§ `C. Section 91 (with 121 and 126(a))`
GIVEN seller IS A `The seller, for section 91`
      kind   IS A `The kind of asset sold, for section 91`
      lst    IS A BOOLEAN
      lstb   IS A BOOLEAN
      fund   IS A BOOLEAN
      rgain  IS A NUMBER
      cgain  IS A NUMBER
      cinfl  IS A NUMBER
      bought IS A DATE
      sold   IS A DATE
      isSec  IS A BOOLEAN
      prof   IS A NUMBER
      expro  IS A BOOLEAN
      yr     IS A NUMBER
      b2     IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A sale for section 91`
`ind sale by` seller `of` kind `, listed` lst `, listed before the change date` lstb `, exempt fund unit` fund `, real gain` rgain `, capital gain` cgain `, chargeable inflationary` cinfl `, bought` bought `, sold` sold `, a security` isSec `, profits of 94B` prof `, expropriated` expro `, reached in` yr `, part of (b2)` b2 MEANS
    `A sale for section 91` WITH
        `the seller` IS seller
        `the kind of asset sold` IS kind
        `registered for trading on a stock exchange` IS lst
        `registered for trading on a stock exchange before the change date` IS lstb
        `a unit in an exempt mutual fund` IS fund
        `the real capital gain` IS rgain
        `the capital gain` IS cgain
        `the chargeable inflationary amount` IS cinfl
        `the purchase day` IS bought
        `the sale day` IS sold
        `the asset is a security` IS isSec
        `the distributable profits of section 94B deducted for a security bought before the fixed date` IS prof
        `the asset was expropriated` IS expro
        `the tax year in which the asset reached the seller` IS yr
        `the part of the real gain equal to depletion, exploration and development deductions or film production expenses on a unit in an oil or film partnership` IS b2

GIVEN yr IS A NUMBER
      rgain IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A sale for section 91`
`ind spreading sale reached in` yr `with real gain` rgain MEANS
    `ind sale by` (`ind seller individual with` `no records`) `of` `any other asset` `, listed` FALSE `, listed before the change date` FALSE `, exempt fund unit` FALSE `, real gain` rgain `, capital gain` rgain `, chargeable inflationary` 0 `, bought` (YMD yr 5 1) `, sold` (YMD 2026 6 30) `, a security` FALSE `, profits of 94B` 0 `, expropriated` FALSE `, reached in` yr `, part of (b2)` 0

GIVEN other  IS A NUMBER
      bands  IS A LIST OF `A band of a marginal scale`
      unused IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A tax year in the period of spreading`
`ind year with other income` other `, scale` bands `, credit points left unused worth` unused MEANS
    `A tax year in the period of spreading` WITH
        `the other taxable income that year` IS other
        `the scale of section 121 for that year` IS bands
        `the value of the credit points left unused that year` IS unused

GIVEN rem  IS A NUMBER
      imps IS A LIST OF `An improvement of the asset`
      hold IS A NUMBER
      i93  IS A NUMBER
      ibuy IS A NUMBER
      d    IS A DATE
GIVETH A `The asset on 31 December 1993`
`ind asset in 1993:` rem `, improvements` imps `, holding expenses` hold `, index 1993` i93 `, index at purchase` ibuy `, bought` d MEANS
    `The asset on 31 December 1993` WITH
        `remaining original price on 31 December 1993` IS rem
        `improvements finished by 31 December 1993` IS imps
        `remaining holding expenses on 31 December 1993` IS hold
        `index on 31 December 1993` IS i93
        `index on the purchase day` IS ibuy
        `purchase day` IS d

