§§ `E. Section 125C`
GIVEN amt IS A NUMBER
      link IS A `How the property carrying the interest is linked to the index`
      b IS A BOOLEAN
      c IS A BOOLEAN
      d IS A BOOLEAN
      e IS A BOOLEAN
      f IS A BOOLEAN
      h IS A BOOLEAN
      i IS A BOOLEAN
      recs IS A LIST OF `The holdings of a person on one day`
GIVETH AN `Interest received by an individual, for section 125C`
`ind receipt of` amt `, linked` link `, books` b `, deduction` c `, special relations` d `, proved good faith` e `, study fund` f `, outside` h `, deemed` i `, holdings` recs MEANS
    `Interest received by an individual, for section 125C` WITH
        `the interest` IS amt
        `how the property carrying the interest is linked` IS link
        `the interest is income under section 2(1), or is recorded or must be recorded in the individual's books` IS b
        `the individual claimed a deduction of interest expenses and linkage differences on the property` IS c
        `the individual's holdings in the paying body` IS recs
        `the individual is an employee of the paying body, supplies it services, sells it goods, or has other special relations with it` IS d
        `the individual proved to the assessing officer that the rate of interest was fixed in good faith and not influenced by those relations` IS e
        `paid from a study fund before the periods of section 9(16A) or (16B) passed, or from a provident fund for benefits to which section 3(d) applies` IS f
        `another condition set by the Minister of Finance with the approval of the Finance Committee holds` IS FALSE
        `paid from a provident fund that is neither a fund for benefits nor a study fund, or from a fund for benefits taxed under section 87` IS h
        `the interest is treated as interest income under section 3(h4)(3)` IS i

