§§ `G. Section 8(c)`
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      a IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A difference of wages or of an annuity`
`ind difference relating to` y `of` a MEANS
    `A difference of wages or of an annuity` WITH
        `the tax year the difference relates to` IS y
        `the amount of the difference`           IS a

GIVEN ds IS A LIST OF `A difference of wages or of an annuity`
GIVETH AN `Income to be spread under section 8(c)`
`ind differences:` ds MEANS `wage differences or annuity differences` ds

GIVEN a IS A NUMBER
      n IS A NUMBER
      w IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `Income to be spread under section 8(c)`
`ind vacation pay of` a `over` n `years, the employee having worked` w `years` MEANS `vacation redemption pay received by an employee` a n w

GIVEN a IS A NUMBER
      ys IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH AN `Income to be spread under section 8(c)`
`ind grant of` a `for the working years` ys MEANS
    `a grant or a commutation of an annuity of paragraph (5) or (6) of the definition of income from personal exertion` a ys NOTHING

`ind default older reading` MEANS `declined where the place of an older difference changes the answer`
`ind default working-years reading` MEANS `declined where the working years outside the six tax years change the answer`

-- S801
#ASSERT `s 8(c) — where is regarded as received` (`ind differences:` (LIST `ind difference relating to` 2022 `of` 20000, `ind difference relating to` 2023 `of` 20000, `ind difference relating to` 2024 `of` 20000)) `received in` 2025 `at a request:` TRUE `, reading an older difference as` `ind default older reading` `and working years outside the six as` `ind default working-years reading` EQUALS LIST `a share in the tax year` 2022 `of` 20000, `a share in the tax year` 2023 `of` 20000, `a share in the tax year` 2024 `of` 20000
-- S802
#ASSERT REFUSED `s 8(c) — where is regarded as received` (`ind differences:` (LIST `ind difference relating to` 2022 `of` 20000, `ind difference relating to` 2023 `of` 20000, `ind difference relating to` 2024 `of` 20000)) `received in` 2025 `at a request:` FALSE `, reading an older difference as` `ind default older reading` `and working years outside the six as` `ind default working-years reading`
