§§ `I. Section 64A2`
GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN
      b IS A NUMBER
      c IS A NUMBER
      d IS A BOOLEAN
      e IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A parcel of land held by a real-estate investment fund`
`ind parcel:` a `, built` b `, buildable` c `, ministerial use managed by the fund` d `, inventory` e MEANS
    `A parcel of land held by a real-estate investment fund` WITH
        `income under section 2(1) or 2(6) arises from letting it and from activity ancillary to the letting, apart from a passing break` IS a
        `the total area of the buildings on it` IS b
        `the area that may be built under the plan that applies to it` IS c
        `it is for a use the Minister of Finance fixed, and the fund or a relative of it provides the management services` IS d
        `it is the fund's business inventory` IS e

GIVEN amt IS A NUMBER
      k IS A `The kind of income of a real-estate investment fund`
GIVETH AN `An item of income of a real-estate investment fund`
`ind item of` amt `of the kind` k MEANS
    `An item of income of a real-estate investment fund` WITH
        `the kind` IS k
        `the amount` IS amt

GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN
      b IS A BOOLEAN
      c IS A DATE
      d IS A MAYBE DATE
      e IS A DATE
GIVETH A `A sale of land by a real-estate investment fund`
`ind land sale:` a `, paragraph (4) land` b `, bought` c `, yielding from` d `, sold` e MEANS
    `A sale of land by a real-estate investment fund` WITH
        `it is land for rental housing` IS a
        `it is land of paragraph (4) of the definition of land for rental housing` IS b
        `the day the fund bought it` IS c
        `the day it became yielding land for rental housing` IS d
        `the day it was sold, or sold in an exempt sale` IS e

-- RF01
