§§ `J. Sections 57, 55(b), 60A(b)(2)`
GIVEN cp IS A NUMBER
      dd IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A member of a collective kibbutz`
`ind member with credit points worth` cp `and deductions of` dd MEANS
    `A member of a collective kibbutz` WITH
        `the value of the credit points the member's family is entitled to` IS cp
        `the deductions allowed under section 47 for the member's family` IS dd

GIVEN i IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`ind scale 121(a) tax on` i MEANS
    IF   i AT MOST 301_200
    THEN i TIMES (31%)
    ELSE IF   i AT MOST 560_280
         THEN 93_372 PLUS (i MINUS 301_200) TIMES (35%)
         ELSE 93_372 PLUS 90_678 PLUS (i MINUS 560_280) TIMES (47%)

