§§ `K to M. Real Estate Taxation Law: s 6(b), s 48A, s 9`
GIVEN rate IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `The seller, for section 91`
`ind land body taxed at` rate MEANS `a body of persons` rate

GIVEN recs IS A LIST OF `The holdings of a person on one day`
GIVETH A `The seller, for section 91`
`ind land individual with` recs MEANS `an individual` recs

GIVEN seller IS A `The seller, for section 91`
      assoc  IS A BOOLEAN
      bett   IS A NUMBER
      rbett  IS A NUMBER
      cinfl  IS A NUMBER
      bought IS A DATE
      sold   IS A DATE
      qual   IS A BOOLEAN
      b4     IS A BOOLEAN
      company IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A sale of a right in land, for section 48A`
`ind land sale by` seller `, land association action` assoc `, betterment` bett `, real betterment` rbett `, chargeable inflationary` cinfl `, bought` bought `, sold` sold `, qualifying apartment` qual `, (b4) conditions` b4 `, company or liquidation` company MEANS
    `A sale of a right in land, for section 48A` WITH
        `the seller` IS seller
        `it is an action in a land association` IS assoc
        `the betterment` IS bett
        `the real betterment` IS rbett
        `the chargeable inflationary amount` IS cinfl
        `the purchase day` IS bought
        `the sale day` IS sold
        `it is a qualifying residential apartment that section 48A(b2) governs` IS qual
        `the conditions of section 48A(b4) hold` IS b4
        `the consideration was influenced by additional building rights, section 48A(b3)` IS FALSE
        `the Director allowed in writing a rate lower than the cap, of` IS NOTHING
        `section 48A(d)(4) excludes the sale` IS FALSE
        `the seller is a company with business income, or an individual who received the right when a company was wound up` IS company

GIVEN day IS A DATE
      value IS A NUMBER
      resident IS A BOOLEAN
      only  IS A BOOLEAN
      sold  IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A purchase of a right in a residential apartment`
`ind purchase on` day `of a right worth` value `, resident individual` resident `, only apartment` only `, sold the other` sold MEANS
    `A purchase of a right in a residential apartment` WITH
        `the day of the sale` IS day
        `the value of the right sold` IS value
        `the buyer is an individual resident in Israel` IS resident
        `the apartment is the buyer's only apartment` IS only
        `the buyer sold the other apartment that was his only one within the period` IS sold
        `the buyer bought the apartment after a purchase-group apartment was delayed, as (c1c)(2)(b1) says` IS FALSE
        `the apartment is a replacement apartment as section 49E(a) means` IS FALSE

GIVETH A MAYBE `Index readings for the amounts of section 9(c1c)`
`ind no index readings` MEANS NOTHING

`ind c1f ends 2026` MEANS `the period ends on 31 December 2026, as the consolidation's note on the extension says`
`ind half default` MEANS `declined where the rounding of a half changes the answer`
`ind c1f default` MEANS `declined where the end of the period changes the answer`

